{"publicId":"b8940df3-4e6e-422e-9b64-f17cab46c434","title":"Alnylam心脏药物Amvuttra销售强劲但股价下跌需解决问题","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-12T11:30:00.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-12T11:30:00.000Z","digest":"Alnylam因心脏药物Amvuttra销售强劲但整体销售增长放缓导致股价下跌，需解决相关问题以维持市场价值。\n\nSTAT News专栏作家Adam Feuerstein指出，尽管Amvuttra在2026年前三季度实现3.2亿美元销售额（同比增长47%），但公司其他管线进展不及预期，导致全年股价下跌23%。Feuerstein强调，Alnylam需在2027年Q1前公布Amvuttra心血管安全性数据，否则可能面临FDA监管审查风险。\n\n目前Amvuttra仅获FDA批准用于治疗丙型肝炎相关肝硬化和高胆固醇血症，尚未获得心脏疾病适应症批准。若后续试验证明其可降低心血管事件风险，Alnylam市值有望回升至2025年峰值（约120亿美元）的80%以上。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-12T11:49:08.726Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Alnylam 需解决心脏药物问题","latestReport":{"id":"jnqv44bgxn3pidjnrrvd0jgac"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f42Z9PwULVyg","title":"解读 Alnylam 的心药问题","firstReportAt":"2026-11-12T11:30:00.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"jnqv44bgxn3pidjnrrvd0jgac","title":"Alnylam 需解决心脏药物问题","summary":"Alnylam 公司因销售增长放缓，股价下跌。尽管其心脏疾病治疗药物 Amvuttra 销售强劲，但公司仍需解决心脏药物相关问题，以维持其市场价值。","source":{"name":"STAT News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T11:30:00.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"jnqv44bgxn3pidjnrrvd0jgac","title":"Alnylam 需解决心脏药物问题","summary":"Alnylam 公司因销售增长放缓，股价下跌。尽管其心脏疾病治疗药物 Amvuttra 销售强劲，但公司仍需解决心脏药物相关问题，以维持其市场价值。","source":{"name":"STAT News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T11:30:00.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-12T12:00:00.000Z","heat":9.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T16:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T17:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T19:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T20:00:00.000Z","heat":7.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","heat":7.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2